24
00:02:07,927 --> 00:02:10,629
[SPEAKER_02]: But the point is, it's not about denying

25
00:02:12,168 --> 00:02:15,190
[SPEAKER_02]: The nature of the body you are paired with.

26
00:02:15,230 --> 00:02:18,593
[SPEAKER_02]: So, it's not about denying the masculinity or denying the femininity.

27
00:02:18,833 --> 00:02:31,463
[SPEAKER_02]: It's about carelessly becoming dependent upon the pleasures of the masculine body or the pleasures of the feminine body, which then results in seeking the external counterpart.

28
00:02:32,564 --> 00:02:38,929
[SPEAKER_02]: So, the whole point is to become developed in regard to your own body, as the other suttas would say.

29
00:02:39,712 --> 00:02:44,897
[SPEAKER_01]: Not about, oh, there is, you know, there is no gender, there is... this masculinity is just an illusion.

30
00:02:46,258 --> 00:02:51,604
