31
00:02:52,224 --> 00:02:53,946
[SPEAKER_02]: But factually, the body is so.

32
00:02:55,227 --> 00:02:55,748
[SPEAKER_02]: It is such.

33
00:02:56,921 --> 00:03:03,283
[SPEAKER_02]: With such hormones, with such predispositions, with such height and shape and so on.

34
