[SPEAKER_02]: All of that you take on just because you were not developed in regard to that initial pleasure that you are paired with, prospect of pleasure that you are paired with your body.

39
00:03:56,299 --> 00:04:02,362
[SPEAKER_02]: So, it's not about denying the masculine or denying the feminine or even denying the attraction.

40
00:04:03,155 --> 00:04:06,196
