64
00:05:36,901 --> 00:05:37,402
[SPEAKER_02]: No, no.

65
00:05:37,422 --> 00:05:38,883
[SPEAKER_02]: Why is it not enough, though?

66
00:05:40,068 --> 00:05:46,272
[SPEAKER_02]: Why, by default, mind that's not developed, why would that mind seek the external counterpart?

67
00:05:46,812 --> 00:05:49,974
[SPEAKER_02]: Why wouldn't the pleasure of masculinity and femininity be enough in itself?

68
00:05:50,114 --> 00:05:54,297
[SPEAKER_02]: Why would you spill outside and seek the union with the external?

69
00:05:54,917 --> 00:05:55,137
[SPEAKER_02]: Why?

70
00:05:55,297 --> 00:05:55,918
[SPEAKER_02]: Why is that?

71
