76
00:06:48,274 --> 00:06:52,736
[SPEAKER_02]: Its sense objects are secondary to the existence of the patiga of your senses.

77
00:06:54,658 --> 00:06:57,700
[SPEAKER_02]: And the only reason you don't see that is because you keep assuming.

78
00:06:57,720 --> 00:07:00,762
[SPEAKER_02]: You keep holding the view that that's first and this is second.

79
00:07:01,383 --> 00:07:03,704
[SPEAKER_02]: This gets attracted to that because of that.

80
00:07:06,206 --> 00:07:08,828
[SPEAKER_02]: And thus, whatever's here is seen as second.

81
00:07:09,648 --> 00:07:11,770
