82
00:07:12,130 --> 00:07:14,132
[SPEAKER_02]: That's why you're not developed in regard to the body.

83
00:07:15,032 --> 00:07:18,695
[SPEAKER_02]: Because you assume the wrong order and the wrong order prevents the development.

84
00:07:19,375 --> 00:07:21,237
[SPEAKER_02]: But if you say, well, it doesn't matter how far

