99
00:08:35,120 --> 00:08:36,440
[SPEAKER_02]: You still remain attracted to it.

100
00:08:38,001 --> 00:08:40,062
[SPEAKER_02]: Perversion of the order, literally.

101
00:08:40,442 --> 00:08:42,703
[SPEAKER_02]: It's due to putting that which is second is first.

102
00:08:43,863 --> 00:08:44,964
[SPEAKER_01]: So, what is first?

103
00:08:45,551 --> 00:08:47,652
[SPEAKER_02]: What is first, is the framework of your senses.

104
00:08:47,692 --> 00:08:48,692
