120
00:09:51,780 --> 00:09:52,560
[SPEAKER_02]: It's inconceivable.

121
00:09:52,580 --> 00:09:56,022
[SPEAKER_02]: Your thoughts cannot even feather the outside of it.

122
00:09:56,523 --> 00:09:58,324
[SPEAKER_02]: The only way to do so is to misconceive it.

123
00:09:58,944 --> 00:10:03,507
[SPEAKER_02]: And through that misconception, that misconception exists as such.

124
00:10:04,688 --> 00:10:07,410
[SPEAKER_02]: So that's why Buddha meant the form finds the footing

125
00:10:08,616 --> 00:10:10,617
