133
00:10:53,391 --> 00:10:56,552
[SPEAKER_02]: So, the clearer that becomes, the lesser

134
00:10:58,992 --> 00:11:12,616
[SPEAKER_02]: So, to speak, the lesser amount of perversion you are living on your day-to-day basis, to the point where the perversion would have been completely, sort of, eradicated.

