152
00:13:13,145 --> 00:13:24,793
[SPEAKER_02]: Because of taking the pressure for granted, as mine, as belonging to me, not having a mind developed in regard to that pressure, means pressure will overwhelm the mind, mind will not overwhelm the pressure.

153
00:13:25,354 --> 00:13:27,035
[SPEAKER_02]: So, by default, that will put you outside.

154
00:13:27,535 --> 00:13:32,639
[SPEAKER_02]: But if you have sustained sufficiently enough, not acting out of that pressure... And with discerning it.

155
00:13:32,879 --> 00:13:39,944
[SPEAKER_02]: With discerning it, guarding of the sense doors, not just, oh, I just keep the precepts because it's my duty, but you recognize that, ah,

156
00:13:41,488 --> 00:14:08,576
[SPEAKER_02]: Intentionally choosing to abstain from thinking about things that would be taking up the pressure, intentionally sort of keeping an eye on your actions, on your decisions, on your choices, on the responsibility behind, that will make you not spill out towards the external world, you are becoming aware, basically, of what is it that you've been doing that's been perpetuating your dependence on the pressure and the external world, which is taking the pressure for granted.

