00:14:46,062 --> 00:14:59,686
[SPEAKER_02]: And when that's sufficiently cultivated, then that whole perverted order that depended on a kind of taking up the pressure is mine, would have faded, faded, or would have diminished, sufficiently for you to see that it has diminished.

